        {
          "id": "perk-closer",
          "title": "Closer",
          "summary": "Fighting - It holds three tiles nearer.",
          "sections": [
            {
              "title": "How it works",
              "kind": "prose",
              "text": "Bought in 3 tiers. Each tier replaces the one below it rather than adding to it, so the effect shown for a tier is the whole of what the perk does at that tier."
            },
            {
              "title": "Tiers",
              "kind": "facts",
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Tier 1",
                  "3 pick points, 400 gold. A creature with reach holds one tile nearer to you than it would to anyone else."
