          "related": [],
          "body": "Bought in 3 tiers, each one costing 3 pick points and more gold than the last.\n\nTier 1 - 3 pick points, 400 gold. A creature with reach holds one tile nearer to you than it would to anyone else.\nTier 2 - 3 pick points, 3,000 gold. It holds two tiles nearer.\nTier 3 - 3 pick points, 15,000 gold. It holds three tiles nearer.",
          "facts": [
