          "body": "Bought in 3 tiers, each one costing 3 pick points and more gold than the last.\n\nTier 1 - 3 pick points, 200 gold. Health and ether return half again as fast.\nTier 2 - 3 pick points, 2,000 gold. Health and ether return twice as fast.\nTier 3 - 3 pick points, 10,000 gold. Health and ether return three times as fast.\n\nWorn gear adds tiers on top of what pick points buy, so this perk goes further than tier 3 for anybody who owns the right piece:\nTier 4 - Health and ether return four times as fast.\nTier 5 - Health and ether return five times as fast.\n\nCarried by: Cape Of Renewal, Fast Regeneration Cape.",
