                ],
                [
                  "Where",
                  "COMMAND_HELP in dev-server/eloria/server.py"
                ],
                [
                  "Then",
                  "A generator like tools/generate_perk_reference.py"
                ]
              ]
            }
          ],
          "body": "TODO. The server keeps a one-line description of every chat command and answers #help with it. That line is all there is: nothing records a command's syntax, what it costs, where it cannot be used, or what it does on success, so a page per command cannot be generated from anything yet.",
          "facts": [
            [
